        "text": "Listening to CDs\nIf you have a CD/DVD player in your PC, you can play your audio CDs while you work\n(or play)! The application you use depends again on your desktop. The following\nsections walk through the most common applications used in the GNOME 3 and\nKDE Plasma desktop environments.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 GNOME 3 and Rhythmbox\n\u2022 KDE Plasma and CDs\n\u2022 VLC to the rescue\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
